  "status": "present",
  "value": "s is a valid expression of non-negative integer literals, binary + - * /, parentheses and unary minus (allowed at the start, after \"(\" and after a binary operator, and stackable). * and / bind tighter than + and -, operators of equal precedence group left to right, and division truncates toward zero. There are no spaces. Return the integer value. Inputs never divide by zero and every intermediate value stays within 1e15 in magnitude.",
